# Volunteering vocabulary

## Namespaces
### Ontology Base URI
prefix :                <https://example.org/ns/>

### Core W3C ontologies (OWL 2 reserved vocabulary)
prefix rdf:             <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
prefix rdfs:            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
prefix owl:             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
prefix xsd:             <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

### Other namespaces used
prefix dc:              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
prefix geo:             <http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#>
prefix geosparql:       <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#>
prefix og:              <http://ogp.me/ns#>
prefix skos:            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
prefix spdx:            <http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#>
prefix time:            <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#>
prefix vcard:           <http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#>
prefix vann:            <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/>


### Object Properties
:ancestor
    a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:TransitiveProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf :descendant ;
    rdfs:label "has ancestor"@en ;
.

:child
    a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf :descendant ;
    rdfs:domain :Parent ;
    rdfs:range :Child ;
    rdfs:label "has child"@en ;
.

:descendant
    a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:TransitiveProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf :ancestor ;
    rdfs:label "has descendant"@en ;
.

:parent
    a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf :child ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf :ancestor ;
    rdfs:domain :Child ;
    rdfs:range :Parent ;
    rdfs:label "has parent"@en ;
.

<x> :child <y> .
<y> :child <z> .
